# Planning — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`.

- Short ADRs for non-obvious choices (auth, payments, storage)
- Dependency order: concept/domain → PHP migrations → API → UI integration
- Risk list early (PII, payments, multi-tenant, offline)
- Definition of done: Profile rules + forms/validation defaults + authz + no secrets
- Open questions written into `concept-domain.mdc` or Project Profile — not chat-only
- Phase gates: do not start the next phase with unresolved blocking questions
